heap_store_stops_lifting.fl:
  before Simplify (10 steps): returns [0: [0: 7; 1]]
  after Simplify (11 steps): returns [0: [0: 7; 1]]
  the check of kinds: passes before, passes after
  the check of static names: passes before, passes after
  calls outside code: 1 before, 1 after
  the same
